          "tags": "RCT (within-subject legs) · untrained young adults · n=20 · 12 wk",
          "detail": "Seated (hip flexed) vs prone leg curl: whole hamstrings volume +14% vs +9% (MRI).",
          "note": "Cited for its muscle growth results at long muscle lengths, not for muscle damage."
